    <p style="text-align: center;"><b>APPROVAL AND CERTIFICATION</b></p>
    <p style="text-align: justify;">The contents of this Circular and the sending thereof to the Shareholders, directors and auditor of the Company have been approved by the Board.</p>
    <p style="text-align: justify;"><b>DATED </b>April 7, 2025.</p>
