    <p style="text-align: justify;">In the event the certification set forth above is not completed, the Company shall deem the Beneficial Owner of the Rights evidenced by this Rights Certificate to be an Acquiring Person or a Related Person thereof (as such terms are defined in the Rights Agreement), and the Election to Purchase will not be honored.</p>
